  "description": {
   "en": "Miki, Emi and Sachi come to the shrine to make a votive plaque. Sachi touches a creepy votive plaque with insects all over the back, and gets a severe headache. When Miki and Emi go to visit Sachi in the nurse's office, they find her completely changed... This museum features many horrifying and bizarre stories surrounding young girls, including \"After School in Hell.\""
